        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghamoash weaghuumeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemaneeda was orjeeda Dawdi ghoaghaambiit geaw aba jeeda gheambalmeadaanyi, nea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI gwandeayi sea niny ak ghwanung' gwaheedu uurdaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool Sulemani fuga sean bea Israeli, ea shirikarajeega miineadayda sagalamnyoojiga ea bughalajeega, ea fuga laja girgweaguutka, ea sugoodiga sean bea Israeli, ea fuga hees bea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Sulemani ea eemeeda mideawa, gaweay heetiyeada mida Gibeoni; aba gideaba maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa bea ASEETA, ghayi sin Musa was siida gadiyeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda dareapcheeda, gwanda hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Nea Dawdi abeeda ea niyeadu sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA Giriat-yearimu ea ghwahita heeda ghayi sissa Dawdi, aba gideaba niminda maheemajeanda jea eayiin jeeda aba Yerusalemu.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heeda wagiida sisna lagheanga oomng'i Sini Besaleli orjeeda Uri, was orjeeda Huri, gwanda madeeda gheeda sibatiisa NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak Sulemani ea eemeeda sean gagaseada NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwadiyeada Sulemani ea ghwahita heeda wagiida sisna lagheanga oomng'i mida madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, mida jeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak ghoadayda lukghumajeega sighwarda was sagalama aba badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eaweedida ghwahidu ASEETA heeda Sulemani aba giirgweatka ak gwayeesha, “Mwasha gida igasayi dagoonyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Sulemani ASEETA, “Ang'iing'i niihiimsi ng'asheega haloodi ea bariinyeega huumwa Dawdeeda was bwaabwa, ak ang'iing'i ea ninung' dawas sugoocheanda aba hoorgeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, nung' ghwahit neajeeda ghayi irukusi Dawdeeda was bwaabwa aba gideaba ninung' dawas sugoocheanda aba badayda fuga saang'a deena birjeanda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goonean weaghuumeeda ea fughareeda jea daamu dabeawa madeedeaba fiisu, aba gideaba gayghoamu ng'eaha ghoahaaghwa fiisu ikaaguuni, was fuga saang'aan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha ASEETA Sulemani, “Aba gideaba ng'asheanji ghayi gwanda jeeda gurooroadaang'u, nea ea mii gakiisiina geaw haleanjeeda, ghana meanang'oocheanduumeeda, ghana weaghuumeeda, ghana eaweega fuga sinyi, nea ea mii gakiisiina geaw eaweega geawi, geaghus gideaba gigakiisi geaw weaghuumeeda ea fughareeda ak ginyasi gichea ahaaghwiita fugeasu, ghayi anung' huwa sugoocheanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi ghamneawa ea sigoonyi weaghuumeeda ea fughareeda, ak aniini gaydeaheaneey haleanjeeda ea meanang'oocheanduumeeda, ea gheawalmeeda gheang'da, ea ghwanaawa gea ghayi mideawa sugoodiga ghayi asheedeawaneey, nea aba badaydaang'u ea maygwanda siichea gwandeawa gea jea ghwanaawa gaagu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda was Sulemani uurdaanyi ea baruureagaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eada Sulemani heetiyeada bea Gibeoni, gidang'eada madeeda maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ea ghwahita Yerusalemu, hean ng'ata ghoahaaghwa fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoamughuush Sulemani mutukwajeega ea fuga ding'iida faraasajeega, nea niny abeeda gwandeawa mutukwaji sagalamda ea bughalaji ang'wan, ea fuga ding'iida faraasajeega was sagalamnyooji damaniyeenya, iin mutukwajeega jeeda mujiinajeega loat, sea sugoocheanda aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanung' sugoocheanda gawuurji lapiya ea dahaabu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lagheanga meeng'meeng'i.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " lagheanga gealaan aba Yerusalemu, ak gubooyeeka ghwanung' gawuurji meaghayga mida Shofela, aba seang'ayda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea faraasajeega, mideawa Sulemani geeyeana ng'eanyiida Misri, ea Gilikia, ak geataw fuga agageakshi bea sugoocheanda hawaniga, gilba was hawanda gaba sheayeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea saawa inyeesa goodiing'da, ak gweana ng'eanyiida Misri mutuku aba shekeelaji bughalaji lah bea lapiya, ea faraasajeega aba bughala ea haradam ea damanamughuush; hean iissa gweasa buuneeda sugoodiga sean bea fuga Hiti, ea sugoodiga Shaamu, ak geayiin geatinga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
